    <title lang="en">Lose the Battle, Win the War</title>
    <desc lang="en">Some say love is a romantic encounter, but marriage is a long struggle for survival. Every couple has likely experienced this: loving each other deeply, yet arguing over trivial matters; men feeling women are unreasonable, and women feeling men are indifferent. Actually, neither side is wrong… Edwin Siu, Raymond Cho, Stephanie Che, and Jinny Ng transform into “survival coaches,” inviting celebrity comrades struggling to “survive” in their marriages to “defuse” marital problems through candid conversations and insightful analyses of male-female behavior. The program also invites experts to join, offering professional perspectives on marital deadlocks and guiding you from “excitement” to “heart-to-heart” communication, thus protecting your marriage!</desc>
